rtical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-3pSkfJZb\"><strong>名称</strong></p></td><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-15GErGDZ\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-Xu6OtkJE\"><strong>类型</strong></p></td><td data-id=\"t1b895c3-PTN2LX9g\" class=\"table-last-row\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-E5KycA59\"><strong>描述</strong></p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-9C0fe7zq\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td class=\"table-last-column\" data-id=\"tfdb4f7e-cCWUjUBN\" colspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-RcCWlrmA\">promotionSelector</p></td><td class=\"table-last-column\" data-id=\"tfdb4f7e-lftbnKZO\" colspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-mI3KwwPT\"><code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">() =&gt; PromotionSelector</code></p></td><td class=\"table-last-row table-last-column\" data-id=\"t632832e-YbXhQCfQ\" colspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-brQfM4mN\">初始化 PromotionSelector，并初始化了 advertiser_id</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><h1 id=\"h346b9f0-XlguUb6C\" data-id=\"h346b9f0-vfWPryNF\">选择器 ProjectSelector</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-yHuCBW4f\">项目选择器对象，用来过滤所需项目；</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-uag9n8yK\">调用选择器的iterator方法，将返回项目迭代器，用于遍历查询。</p><h2 data-id=\"h490b8bf-Xm3ciLYJ\" id=\"h490b8bf-TFRG2vZT\">方法</h2><div class=\"table-container qz-card-type-block\"><table data-custom=\"false\" data-id=\"t75ae23f-9bdJVWMf\" class=\"data-table\" data-transient-attributes=\"class\" style=\"width: 100%; outline: none; border-collapse: collapse; max-width: 100%;\" data-width=\"100%\"><colgroup data-id=\"c7104f7d-64OYWVsd\"><col width=\"33.33333333333333%\" data-id=\"cd11d5e0-k6M4DmR9\" span=\"1\"><col width=\"33.33333333333333%\" data-id=\"cd11d5e0-NjNGKXFb\" span=\"1\"><col width=\"33.33333333333333%\" data-id=\"cd11d5e0-Ho2C3KeM\" span=\"1\"></colgroup><tbody data-id=\"t6d5e859-6jXujOyj\"><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-C6WQhdDZ\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-4sJpBHLU\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-HkDYyT5T\"><strong>名称</strong></p></td><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-Qulv4bZg\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-rAXPHF2w\"><strong>类型</strong></p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"t1b895c3-cfnV448T\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-O05t6L4j\"><strong>描述</strong></p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-vteJA2z4\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-TAHoJ1Ys\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-GCjP2Kvr\">withAdvId</p></td><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-bRomtGwy\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-gDww1rzx\"><code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">(advertiser_id) =&gt; this</code></p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"t1b895c3-R8Bcz5pE\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-JZlCjl2s\">指定查询某个advertiser_id下的项目</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-8ytWSRv5\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"t882b249-ZPQQjKQg\" colspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-xlDW4iI3\">withFields</p></td><td data-id=\"t882b249-89RinH0b\" colspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-eHiZD7iV\"><code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">(fields: string[]) =&gt; this</code></p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"t7e901cd-629C94IA\" colspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-wisWDKvU\">指定查询字段集合。若指定则获取的Project对象仅具有指定字段。</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-lIj3Jy8w\">可从&nbsp;<a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1740937147595776\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">获取项目列表 - 应答参数</a> data.list[]的子字段中，选择传入</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-6DIG6qDL\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"t882b249-GNJbDXQ2\" colspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-C9x2bbOI\">withFiltering</p></td><td data-id=\"t882b249-dsAnBlqR\" colspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-AFunAa9Y\"><code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">(filtering: object) =&gt; this</code></p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"t7e901cd-ScLl8FaO\" colspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-OI5PDfQk\">指定过滤条件，传入字段参考&nbsp;<a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1740937147595776\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">获取项目列表 - 请求参数</a></p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-SQ5TmJxk\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td class=\"table-last-column\" data-id=\"tfdb4f7e-0R7S1eXe\" colspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-VswycOwP\">iterator</p></td><td class=\"table-last-column\" data-id=\"tfdb4f7e-KlmiP1Ep\" colspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-Ao4vIBnH\"><code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">() =&gt; AsyncIterable&lt;Project&gt;</code></p></td><td class=\"table-last-column table-last-row\" data-id=\"t960a29a-IDb2VfKN\" colspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-9veon4Pf\">用上面构建好的请求参数，获取项目列表，调用 MAPI 接口：<a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1740937147595776\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">获取项目列表</a></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-zecNC9Gn\">需通过 for await of 遍历</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-BXd3JjNi\" id=\"h346b9f0-BXd3JjNi\">代码示例</h1><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view qz-codeblock qz-card-type-block\" data-type=\"codeblock\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22wrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22language%22%3A%22javascript%22%2C%22theme%22%3A%22QZtheme%22%2C%22height%22%3A%22auto%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%2F%2F%20%E4%BB%A3%E7%A0%81%E5%85%A5%E5%8F%A3%5Cnexport%20async%20function%20main()%20%7B%5Cn%20%20const%20myPromotions%20%3D%20%5B%5D%3B%5Cn%20%20const%20agents%20%3D%20await%20Mapi.getAgents()%3B%5Cn%20%20for%20(const%20agent%20of%20agents)%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20const%20advs%20%3D%20agent.advSelector().iterator()%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20for%20await%20(const%20adv%20of%20advs)%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%20%E6%9F%A5%E8%AF%A2%E5%87%BA%E8%B6%85%E9%A2%84%E7%AE%97%E7%9A%84%E9%A1%B9%E7%9B%AE%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20const%20projects%20%3D%20adv%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20.projectSelector()%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20.withFiltering(%7B%20status%3A%20'PROJECT_STATUS_BUDGET_EXCEED'%20%7D)%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20.iterator()%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20for%20await%20(const%20project%20of%20projects)%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20console.log(project.detail.name)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%7D%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%20%E5%8F%91%E9%80%81%E7%9B%91%E6%8E%A7%E6%8A%A5%E8%AD%A6...%5Cn%20%20%20%20%7D%5Cn%20%20%7D%5Cn%5Cn%20%20return%20'ok'%3B%5Cn%7D%5Cn%22%2C%22disabled%22%3Afalse%2C%22id%22%3A%22toPlh%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22block%22%7D\"><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view_contain qz-codeblock_inner\"><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view_scroll qz-codeblock-scroll\" style=\"height: auto; max-height: 600px; overflow-y: scroll;\"><div class=\"qz-codeblock_content javascript\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view qz-codeblock qz-card-type-block\" data-type=\"codeblock\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22wrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22language%22%3A%22javascript%22%2C%22theme%22%3A%22QZtheme%22%2C%22height%22%3A%22auto%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%2F%2F%20%E5%B7%B2%E7%9F%A5advertiser_id%E7%9A%84%E6%83%85%E5%86%B5%E4%B8%8B%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E6%9F%A5%E8%AF%A2%E8%AF%A5advertiser%E4%B8%8B%E7%9A%84project%5Cnconst%20adv%20%3D%20new%20Mapi.Adv(%7Badvertiser_id%3A%20123%7D)%5Cnconst%20projects%20%3D%20adv.projectSelector().withFiltering(%7B%E5%A1%AB%E5%85%A5%E7%AD%9B%E9%80%89%E6%9D%A1%E4%BB%B6%7D).iterator()%5Cnfor%20await%20(const%20project%20of%20projects)%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%20%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22disabled%22%3Afalse%2C%22id%22%3A%22tCZ7i%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22block%22%7D\"><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view_contain qz-codeblock_inner\"><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view_scroll qz-codeblock-scroll\" style=\"height: auto; max-height: 600px; overflow-y: scroll;\"><div class=\"qz-codeblock_content javascript\"></div></div></div></div></div>",
